abla f\left( {x,y} ight) = \left( {2x - 2} ight)\mathbf{i} + \left( {8y + 8} ight)\mathbf{j}} \ {
abla g\left( {x,y} ight) = \mathbf{i} + 2\mathbf{j}.} \end{array}$$ The equation $$
abla f\left( {x_{0},y_{0}} ight) = \lambda
abla g\left( {x_{0},y_{0}} ight)$$ becomes $$\left( {2x_{0} - 2} ight)\mathbf{i} + \left( {8y_{0} + 8} ight)\mathbf{j} = \lambda\left( {\mathbf{i} + 2\mathbf{j}} ight),$$ which can be rewritten as $$\left( {2x_{0} - 2} ight)\mathbf{i} + \left( {8y_{0} + 8} ight)\mathbf{j} = \lambda\mathbf{i} + {2\lambda}\mathbf{j}.$$ Next, we set the coefficients of $$\mathbf{i} 	ext{and} \mathbf{j}$$ equal to each other: $$ egin{array}{l} {2x_{0} - 2 = \lambda} \ {8y_{0} + 8 = 2\lambda.} \end{array}$$ The equation $$g\left( {x_{0},y_{0}} ight) = 0$$ becomes $$x_{0} + 2y_{0} - 7 = 0.$$ Therefore, the system of equations that needs to be solved is $$ egin{array}{rll} {2x_{0} - 2} & = & \lambda \ {8y_{0} + 8} & = & {2\lambda} \ {x_{0} + 2y_{0} - 7} & = & 0. \end{array}$$

So, we calculate the gradients of both $$f 	ext{and}$$ $$g:$$ $$ egin{array}{l} {
abla f\left( {x,y} ight) = \left( {48 - 2x - 2y} ight)\mathbf{i} + \left( {96 - 2x - 18y} ight)\mathbf{j}} \ {
abla g\left( {x,y} ight) = 5\mathbf{i} + \mathbf{j}.} \end{array}$$ The equation $$
abla f\left( {x_{0},y_{0}} ight) = \lambda
abla g\left( {x_{0},y_{0}} ight)$$ becomes $$\left( {48 - 2x_{0} - 2y_{0}} ight)\mathbf{i} + \left( {96 - 2x_{0} - 18y_{0}} ight)\mathbf{j} = \lambda\left( {5\mathbf{i} + \mathbf{j}} ight),$$ which can be rewritten as $$\left( {48 - 2x_{0} - 2y_{0}} ight)\mathbf{i} + \left( {96 - 2x_{0} - 18y_{0}} ight)\mathbf{j} = \lambda 5\mathbf{i} + \lambda\mathbf{j}.$$ We then set the coefficients of $$\mathbf{i} 	ext{and} \mathbf{j}$$ equal to each other: $$ egin{array}{rll} {48 - 2x_{0} - 2y_{0}} & = & {5\lambda} \ {96 - 2x_{0} - 18y_{0}} & = & {\lambda.} \end{array}$$ The equation $$g\left( {x_{0},y_{0}} ight) = 0$$ becomes $$5x_{0} + y_{0} - 54 = 0.$$ Therefore, the system of equations that needs to be solved is $$ egin{array}{rll} {48 - 2x_{0} - 2y_{0}} & = & {5\lambda} \ {96 - 2x_{0} - 18y_{0}} & = & \lambda \ {5x_{0} + y_{0} - 54} & = & 0. \end{array}$$

Next, we calculate $$
abla f\left( {x,y,z} ight)$$ and $$
