abla g\left( {x,y,z} ight) = \left\langle 1,1,1 ightangle.} \end{array}$$ This leads to the equations $$ egin{array}{rll} \left\langle 2x_{0},2y_{0},2z_{0} ightangle & = & {\lambda\left\langle 1,1,1 ightangle} \ {x_{0} + y_{0} + z_{0} - 1} & = & 0 \end{array}$$ which can be rewritten in the following form: $$ egin{array}{rll} {2x_{0}} & = & \lambda \ {2y_{0}} & = & \lambda \ {2z_{0}} & = & \lambda \ {x_{0} + y_{0} + z_{0} - 1} & = & 0. \end{array}$$

